<title>CANADA: DBRS confirms Cameco debt.</title>
<headline>DBRS confirms Cameco debt.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dominion Bond Rating Service said on Friday it was confirming the ratings of Cameco Corp senior debt at A and its commercial paper at R-1 (low).</p>
<p>The agency added that it maintained the negative trend for the long-term debt rating.</p>
<p>&quot;The negative trend for the long-term rating recognizes the additional risk associated with the financing and developing of the remote Kumtor gold deposit located in the former Soviet Union,&quot; DBRS said.</p>
<p>It said the confirmation reflected the advantages of Cameco's low-cost uranium operations in northern Saskatchewan.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
